ent in Endless Mode and uncover new Weapons!\n\u2022Be aware of the Bizarre Boss Bat to Beat at the end of the Campaign mode!\n\u2022Be Brash, Barge your way to the top of the Boards!\n\u2022Boatloads of content, you won't Believe it's only a couple of Bucks!\n\nBut Beware, of your Beloved Belongings behind you, isn\u2019t Bitten By a Bunch of Bad Batty Bats or it\u2019s Bedtime!", "short_description": "Be the Best and Beat those Bad Batty Bats Back! In this wacky Arcade Style Pinball-Breakout-Bat-Batting mashup!"}]}, "developer_name": "ROCCAT Games Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.elevator-tothemoon.com/en/PrivacyPolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.elevator-tothemoon.com/en/TermsOfServices/", "publisher_name": "ROCCAT Games Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.elevator-tothemoon.com/en/Home/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "ARCADE", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "de", "es", "fr"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "966668817577257"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982505_1619492498196984_8762059860268285952_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NHb-HTl_VMYQ7kNvwGW8kbG&_nc_oc=Adn50PgeS7wXHNm3dGA6B4sXjsGekdx8MGUpT5f3YcXouwL8H5F48MVYZXr-qH5b3w4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw8ZCcSGhBW8I3L7x5YuwDWM5QjA16DgFPy4mEH2EGa_g&oe=69BAAE78"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial